  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIGA - Support to Ukraine&#x2019;s Reconstruction and Economy Trust Fund (SURE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIGA&apos;s &quot;Support to Ukriane&apos;s Reconstruction and Economy Trust Fund&quot; (SURE TF) is part of the wider World Bank Group response to supporting Ukraine. With the help of funds contributed to SURE TF, MIGA can expand its suite of products to reduce the risk for investors and private sector at large in operating in Ukraine during the conflict and preparing for when reconstruction may commence. As a mechanism to provide war insurance cover, it aims to reduce risk for investors in continuing to operate in and with Ukraine as well as to prepare for the reconstruction.</narrative>
  </description>
